# ==========================================
# 1. WHITELIST: Ignore everything by default
# ==========================================
/*

# ==========================================
# 2. ALLOWLIST: Only track what is needed
# ==========================================
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/go.mod
!/go.sum
!/*.go

# Allow assets directory and its contents
!/assets/
!/assets/**

# ==========================================
# 3. FAILSAFE: Never track sensitive / build files
# ==========================================
config.json
*.exe
*.app
*.zip
*.spec
*.DS_Store
*.vscode/
.vscode/
RoSniper-*
rosniper-go.exe
rosniper.exe
launcher
_internal/
__pycache__/
readme-media/
